\begin_layout Section
Contribution
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
In this work, a novel technique is presented that extends a previously developed
 expert program with genetic programming.
 The scope of the extensions is calculated using the tree edit distance
 so that the candidates have stronger similarity to the original strategy,
 which arguably leads to more easily interpretable candidates.
 To further enhance familiarity in the solutions, techniques such as defining
 a fixed core structure or tree unification are implemented.
 Familiar genetic programming is a novel approach in the domain of explainable
 artificial intelligence 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "fehrer_hein_tokic_udluft_2020"
literal "true"

\end_inset

.
 
\end_layout

