\backslash
approx 5-10$ steps
\end_layout

\end_inset

).
 As can be seen in 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand formatted
reference "fig:sarsa75-paretos"

\end_inset

, methods that further restricted the evolutionary process, such as a fixed
 core or a reduced operator set, improved the online performance.
